# Every Engine v2 program on a machine shared with today's system (Engine v2 O17, #2810): the worlds (worldd@), the
# gateways, the directory and the origin. Memory is capped: O14 (v2/docs/machines.md) lets today's worlds use at most
# 26 GB of a 31 GB machine, and 3 GB here leaves them that. The processor and the disk are shared, never capped: at
# weight 20 against the default 100 the new system gets a fifth of what today's gets when both are busy, and all of it
# when today's is idle, so neither system's world time is throttled. A world's own limit (worldd@, 2 GB) holds inside.
[Unit]
Description=Souls Engine v2 programs

[Slice]
MemoryMax=3G
MemorySwapMax=0
CPUWeight=20
IOWeight=20
TasksMax=4096
